! History — Provenance Records

Development arc records: origin conversations, early drafts, reasoning that produced current design doctrine.
These memes show //how// the design arrived, not //what// it contains.
Doctrine lives in `bags/` and `packages/`. These records live here.

<<~/ahu >>

